    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop trying to force the light\"... that's almost exactly how it feels. like i'm just fighting a losing battle against nothing. but what does \"stopping\" even look like? i just want to sleep and never have to feel this heavy or this drained ever again.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
